sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Saga Orchestrator
    participant O as order-db
    participant P as payment-db
    participant I as inventory-db

    S->>O: create order
    S->>P: charge payment
    S->>I: reserve stock
    I-->>S: insufficient stock
    S->>P: refund payment
    S->>O: log COMPENSATED payment_charged
    S->>O: cancel order
    S->>O: log COMPENSATED order_created
